 297:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  * - When calculating to smaller color type simply shift out the LSBs
 298:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****  *   E.g.  8 bit Red has 3 bits
